sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P0 as BFF replica 1
    participant P1 as Redis
    participant P2 as BFF replica 2
    participant P3 as Identity Provider
    P0->>P1: Acquire lease
    P2->>P1: Wait for owner
    P0->>P1: Re-read version
    P0->>P3: Refresh exchange
    P3-->>P0: New token pair
    P0->>P1: Fenced token write
    P0->>P1: Owner release
    P2->>P1: Load new version
    P2->>P2: Relay new access token
